# Deck presets — snapshots of whatever cards a wizard happened to be carrying,
# personal to one account and not meaningful to anyone else.  strategies/duel/
# and strategies/player/ stay tracked: those are shareable strategy definitions.
# Deck data embedded in a bot_strategies/ file is also tracked — it is part of
# what makes that specific strategy runnable.
# The directory is recreated on demand (list_deck_presets tolerates it missing).
strategies/decks/

